# paper-submit 环境变量示例。复制到 ~/.config/paper-submit/env，chmod 600，按需修改；
# 在 shell 配置里加载：set -a; . ~/.config/paper-submit/env; set +a
# 说明见 references/setup.md。

# 密码来源二选一：直接给值，或给一条输出密码的命令（推荐后者，真值留在你的凭证库里）
# PAPER_SUBMIT_DEFAULT_PASSWORD='change-me'
PAPER_SUBMIT_PASSWORD_CMD='pass show paper-submit/default'

# 别人的账号（只读查状态用）：secret 名列表 + 取值命令（脚本执行 "<命令> <KEY>"）
# PAPER_SUBMIT_EXTRA_SECRETS=ADVISOR_MTS_PASSWORD
# PAPER_SUBMIT_SECRET_CMD='pass show paper-submit'

PAPER_SUBMIT_HOME="$HOME/.local/share/paper-submit"
PAPER_SUBMIT_CONFIG_DIR="$HOME/.config/paper-submit"
PAPER_SUBMIT_DISPLAY=:97
# PAPER_SUBMIT_SCREEN=1440x960x24
# PAPER_SUBMIT_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:7890
# PAPER_SUBMIT_PLAYWRIGHT=playwright-cli
# PAPER_SUBMIT_SYSTEMD=auto
